lf-contract 0.1
# A deliberately wrong contract: MAX and MIN exchanged in the result. The
# generator must find a counterexample and Lean must prove it false.
id lf-clamp/wrong-swapped
word lf-clamp
ir tests/program/ir/clamp.ir
stack ( value lower upper -- result true | false )
inputs value lower upper
statement Wrong on purpose: claims the result is max(min(v, l), u).
case lower > upper
  out false
case lower <= upper
  out r true
  ensure r = max(min(value, lower), upper)
expect refuted
